{"availability":"available","full":"fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial","name":"django-adminlte3-tutorial","description":"A short writeup on using AdminLTE in Django projects via the django-adminlte3 pip module","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":21,"forks":9,"created":"2020-04-23T23:50:09Z","updated":"2024-06-14T20:00:41Z","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://adminlte.io/themes/v3/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.369Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.369Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.369Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.369Z","stars":21,"forks":9}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["django-adminlte3 is a Python module which \"provides the functionality of the AdminLTE3 theme to Django developers in the form of standard base templates. Optional styling for Django's built-in admin interface is also provided.\"","In short, it lets you make your Django projects look very pretty with a consistent looking UI for minimal effort. Kudos to the AdminLTE folks for the template, and to the Python dev who created this module."],"features":["This falls under the \"if you break it, you get to keep both pieces\" type licensing. ;-)","I mostly wrote this for my future self, as otherwise inevitably I'll forget how to use this. So any/all goofs/etc. are my own. It may also change over time. Fair warning.","Of course, if it benefits you in any way, fantastic. If this saves anyone even a minute of time, I take it as a win. To me time is one of the greatest gifts we can offer another person.","Feel free to provide feedback/corrections, though bear with me if I'm slow in responding.","This is by no means a Django tutorial. For that I suggest starting with the official Django documentation which includes a nice walkthrough and tutorial. There are also a ton of useful books, online course, YouTube…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"72e6f3c1e9e4ee3c4d6e86a649ac2b52179d1def56fca802ffaa0961cebfeddd","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.532Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.532Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"django-adminlte3 is a Python module which \"provides the functionality of the AdminLTE3 theme to Django developers in the form of standard base templates. Optional styling for Django's built-in admin interface is also provided.\"","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Create superuser account (so you can access Django admin pages):","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login and make note of how things look.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"72e6f3c1e9e4ee3c4d6e86a649ac2b52179d1def56fca802ffaa0961cebfeddd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.533Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-06-14T20:00:41Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fseesink/django-adminlte3-tutorial/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T21:23:27.534Z","hash":"72e6f3c1e9e4ee3c4d6e86a649ac2b52179d1def56fca802ffaa0961cebfeddd","originalBytes":16206,"storedBytes":16206,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["django","static","adminlte","django-adminlte3","files","template","which","admin","pip","testadminlte3","testapp","adminlte3","app","file","main","page","see","block","create","default","note","project","repo","templates","how","there","things","what","content","endblock","make","sidebar.html","steps","where","any","apps","customized","environment","lib","logo","manage.py","modify","module","python3","reload",